{"type":"message","id":"4cef44eb","parentId":"e58975d0","timestamp":"2026-03-18T12:11:33.519Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_atgz5xygsorPuWvp71hnloxE|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169ba9674a18c819181b73807168c35cc","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/article-to-infographic/skill.json:5:  \"author\": \"OpenClaw\",\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/article-to-infographic/SKILL.md:434:## OpenClaw / Non-Interactive Adaptation\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/article-to-infographic/SKILL.md:436:When deploying to environments without interactive question-answer support (e.g., OpenClaw, API-only setups), the skill operates in **parameterized mode** where ALL options must be specified upfront.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tencent-docs/SKILL.md:71:在 OpenClaw 中使用时，需要先完成本地安装和注册。\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tencent-docs/setup.sh:2:# Setup script for 腾讯文档 MCP Skill (内部 OpenClaw 版本)\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tencent-docs/setup.sh:6:echo \"🚀 设置腾讯文档 MCP Skill（OpenClaw 版本）...\"\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tencent-docs/setup.sh:28:echo \"ℹ️  TENCENT_DOCS_TOKEN 环境变量由 OpenClaw runtime 自动提供\"\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/skill-vetter/SKILL.md:123:1. **Official OpenClaw skills** → Lower scrutiny (still review)\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/scripts/recover_loop.js:23:  // In OpenClaw exec, cwd is usually the workspace root.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:9:**Capability Evolver** 是一个元技能（Meta-Skill），赋予 OpenClaw 智能体自我反省的能力。它可以扫描自身的运行日志，识别效率低下或报错的地方，并自主编写代码补丁来优化自身性能。\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:195:`index.js` 和 `evolve.js` 中的 `sessions_spawn(...)` 字符串是**输出到 stdout 的纯文本**，而非直接函数调用。是否被执行取决于宿主运行时（如 OpenClaw 平台）。进化引擎本身不将 `sessions_spawn` 作为可执行代码调用。\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:113:The **Capability Evolver** is a meta-skill that allows OpenClaw agents to inspect their own runtime history, identify failures or inefficiencies, and autonomously write new code or update their own memory to improve performance.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:242:This skill is designed to be **environment-agnostic**. It uses standard OpenClaw tools by default.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:222:The `sessions_spawn(...)` strings in `index.js` and `evolve.js` are **text output to stdout**, not direct function calls. Whether they are interpreted depends on the host runtime (e.g., OpenClaw platform). The evolver itself does not invoke `sessions_spawn` as executable code.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:226:This skill is designed to be **environment-agnostic**. It uses standard OpenClaw tools by default.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-17.md:9:- OpenClaw 状态巡检完成：Feishu 渠道正常，当前会话正常\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-17.md:11:- OpenClaw 提示有可用更新：npm 2026.3.13\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-17.md:14:- 评估是否升级 OpenClaw\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/.trash/skills/liang-tavily-search-20260318-152118/SKILL.md:14:Get your API key at https://tavily.com and add to your OpenClaw config:\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html:157:            <div class=\"eyebrow\">OpenClaw 工作流升级 · 封面</div>\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html:313:        <h2 class=\"title sm\">今天还顺手走通了一次 OpenClaw 深度巡检与故障定位路径。</h2>\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html:350:              <div class=\"item\">把 OpenClaw 助手从“能用”优化到“能长期协作”，我今天做了什么？</div>\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xiaohongshu.html:348:          <div class=\"cover-eyebrow\">OpenClaw 工作流升级 · 封面页</div>\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xiaohongshu.html:382:        <h1 class=\"hero-title\">今天，我把自己的 OpenClaw 工作流又打磨了一轮。</h