bXM8uYs1CPPKFZm4YPiok-BVgZkAN2uXWZY8HX0e0v7IjXmBD37u_ig_yRDHF2Pe0meDC_ud2T0Mlyo_4QObTJllV_apTb8HSjkZIZ9cscxP_LBzuchuE3b2a_7xoI0D7Z70ZsO7ry-O-u3OpTsYjw8r_jAjrTeqimhv4=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Analyzing skill installation process**\\n\\nI need to investigate how to install a skill based on the existing policy. Maybe I should look into available skills using find-skills? However, I still have to focus on installing the requested skill.\\n\\nIt seems like I need to prioritize SkillHub first, and then consider ClawHub as a backup. I’ll make sure to read the relevant documentation, specifically SKILL.md, to understand how to manage the process correctly.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xqN4zb8oPTx5wNJEQyuJ6zWq|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa10757988191b2d0021cb4a72470","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.8_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.8_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":48456,"output":192,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53256,"cost":{"input":0.12114000000000001,"output":0.00288,"cacheRead":0.001152,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.125172}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773838590190}}
{"type":"message","id":"b0ca2343","parentId":"89e9b95e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T12:56:39.621Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_xqN4zb8oPTx5wNJEQyuJ6zWq|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa10757988191b2d0021cb4a72470","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773838599614}}
