Em\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering next steps**\\n\\nI’m thinking I need to act on the previous offer, which likely involves both initialization and auditing. The term “继续” feels a bit ambiguous, so I should proceed with a sensible next step that might involve both aspects. I'm wondering if I need to apply any specific skills for this. I could also look into self-improving agent installation, but it seems no specific skill is required right now. I might read about the installed skill more.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我继续往下做：先把 `.learnings/` 初始化，再顺手把这个 skill 快速审一遍，告诉你值不值得长期开。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baa49f8aa48191a75273bfe216a156\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_VWJFQsogVZ6m4L7J3HrRfiaB|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4a0990c819192a61711ffcbd4d5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings && ls -la /root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"mkdir -p /root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings && ls -la /root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FmeuombpPBNBLhAD2FraemGk|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4a0991c819189efba4958e7666d","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/self-improving-agent/assets/LEARNINGS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/self-improving-agent/assets/LEARNINGS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_uN939IDZStTl8W42Q0OC3ypN|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4a099248191b1ff65f464ac7407","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/self-improving-agent/assets/ERRORS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/self-improving-agent/assets/ERRORS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cRzAshh8V2e6yWEBfaBJTHWs|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4a09928819182d8e6651d52326