{"type":"message","id":"e2f087de","parentId":"0dd8d482","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:12:08.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating asset names**\n\nI need to take a closer look at the tree and maybe investigate some specific asset names associated with it. Understanding how everything is organized will help me assess what’s important. There's a lot to consider in terms of relationships or dependencies between these assets. Alright, I’ll get started on this inspection — I’m curious to see how it all fits together!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4a537a08191a9420a454d6890b2\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuqSnzC6xdJIsu1Jzm8x7uStUvXHjV-Uwz9gLiLniROhcNwWHXYpPypxP2Z-UxUKEX2Mu4d_G2Ywu7X4A0AuQXOVTqUtyJQmrJauWYBTAip3r5dWFCTkd71aUe5lciB7nhVlKK4tVhODG_ZsIX8ul2H12DSPLh85-BR02BMEkQwJbBjgugJ3IMraBF34kKGxsRCCBw5lElwyHHcP5Smgcfrn6XNB8n51PNNi1nkyVBTwaJ_hLPLOi0ywVhNcONhvw0sv2zuYXVURcSik0IMUth8yCzDgAoN-7kXof_5YoU_Ji-wKmHe0N_WlWI6Y9db2SJS_Vxjcgg8CL4l9r55OV0icw0mDi1P976clI4SxVygzf-ghh-McpIHjbXM43w9M_n6BPp8fIpLTK3biMlwfkFl4rHbflL2K6x8r6JyZZIhksX5YlVpMThEP869h3sogThGtJHiayBtfqrcmHNpyd7jtFhIBcEXRk5eBENgAu0MO2WGoZpqYkEAySCdySaWlhhCEOKaVx2zTB7htwmHj02nCi-NDtB-v9FyuKdmJCtR_yY5vsmU5mGgGTt4-Zq0nQP3fMGDvZ0NnYLfQgzvHBqkigMdG9Qj6kmIDOT-AzS4wZ9Mi16ZoIt_WHaPNfljoH672RTNjlDuxa0wQ65xQVD4FzFENo1sH2YSBisDljK7SLisnUls-1Df4qP-h_T71vpe38zv7mb2RJlYUEtA8Z6gVz-dQ0O9FvtsVUGBo1RFLNtC-ihnVPBG3NYfdMd60V_KwT5iABVyKz-hXjcZNETIdBkPcUv0PAiORG-BJFJWWlhDuPwzQ-ihB1Akt85_sfAxuMueW4sKq3HKve4DOfr-IqwrwUGMdFK04QobRQZS0HF0o=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Investigating asset names**\\n\\nI need to take a closer look at the tree and maybe investigate some specific asset names associated with it. Understanding how everything is organized will help me assess what’s important. There's a lot to consider in terms of relationships or dependencies between these assets. Alright, I’ll get started on this insp