{"type":"message","id":"a859032c","parentId":"a396731e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:12:36.435Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 继续完了。  \n\n**我已经做的**\n- 已初始化目录：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/`\n- 已创建 3 个文件：\n  - `LEARNINGS.md`\n  - `ERRORS.md`\n  - `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n\n**这个 skill 我给你的判断**\n- **能用**，而且跟你现在要做的 OpenClaw 调优、Bug 追踪挺契合\n- **优点**：能把“踩坑—修正—沉淀”这条链路固定下来，避免同类错误反复犯\n- **问题**：这个 skill 偏“通用自改进模板”，不是专门为你当前工作流深度定制的  \n  说白了：**适合拿来打底，不适合无脑全信**\n\n**我看到的几个点**\n1. 它主要依赖 `.learnings/` 写日志  \n   这个没问题，风险低\n\n2. 它建议把稳定经验提升到 `AGENTS.md / TOOLS.md / SOUL.md / MEMORY.md`  \n   这个思路是对的，但**必须人工筛选**，不然很容易把噪音写进长期记忆\n\n3. 它带了 hook 方案  \n   **我暂时没帮你启用 hook**，因为 hook 会影响会话行为，属于该谨慎一点的操作  \n   先手动跑一阵，更稳\n\n4. 文档里有个细节不严谨  \n   它写的是 `clawdhub install`，但你这里实际走的是 `skillhub install`  \n   说明这个 skill 不是完全按你当前环境打磨过的\n\n**我的建议**\n- **现在就这样用，没问题**\n- **先别开自动 hook**\n- **把它当“学习日志层”用，不要让它自动改你的核心人格/规则**\n- 后面如果你真准备搞 “OpenClaw 自我提升系统”，我建议我直接帮你做一个**范总专用版 self-improving-agent**，比这个通用版更适合你\n\n如果你点头，我下一步直接帮你做这两个动作之一：\n\n1. **把这个 skill 接入你当前工作流规范**  \n   我来补一版适合你的使用规则\n\n2. **基于它给你做一个中文版/定制版 skill**  \n   专门服务你的 OpenClaw 自我优化计划","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baa4ba428481919f4e77e37f2b1841\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":174,"output":552,"cacheRead":60416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61142,"cost":{"input":0.00043500000000000006,"output":0.008280000000000001,"cacheRead":0.015104,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023819}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773839543318}}
{"type":"message","id":"85640d7d","parentId":"a859032c","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:40:39.574Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b549efba460a0b49898a890b7ee0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 21:40 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b549efba460a0b49898a890b7ee0]\n范: 继续"}],"timestamp":1773841239567}}
