{"type":"message","id":"8073f379","parentId":"997f27a2","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:41:24.025Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_S0KYqNNYvCR2S56wSTIbOeep|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baab7f539c8191a2af5072b194f7b5","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 36 Skills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n 37 \n 38 ---\n 39 \n+40 ## Self-Improvement Skill Notes\n+41 \n+42 - `.learnings/` directory is initialized in this workspace\n+43 - Use it to record **errors, corrections, and missing capabilities**\n+44 - Do not treat `.learnings/` as authoritative memory\n+45 - Before promoting anything from `.learnings/`, verify it is not a one-off or environment-specific issue\n+46 - Never write tokens, passwords, secrets, private code snippets, or user-sensitive data into `.learnings/`\n+47 - Hook mode is currently **not enabled**; keep logging manual unless the user explicitly asks to automate it\n+48 \n 40 Add whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.","firstChangedLine":40},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773841284017}}
{"type":"message","id":"bede55e0","parentId":"8073f379","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:41:39.949Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_45YYXLDR0vSNQRFau1nfifBd|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baab8caeb08191be343ae4abc04f19","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/README.md","content":"# .learnings 使用规则\n\n这个目录是**暂存层**，不是长期记忆层。\n\n## 记录什么\n\n### 1. ERRORS.md\n记录：\n- 命令失败\n- tool 调用失败\n- 外部 API 异常\n- 文档与实际行为不一致的初步发现\n\n### 2. LEARNINGS.md\n记录：\n- 用户明确纠正\n- 已验证的更优做法\n- 重复出现的工作流经验\n- 已确认的知识缺口\n\n### 3. FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\n记录：\n- 当前不会、但用户明确需要的新能力\n- 适合以后沉淀成 skill / workflow / script 的需求\n\n## 不记录什么\n\n- 密码、密钥、token、恢复码\n- 私人代码、未发布内容、敏感日志\n- 只出现一次、未经验证的猜测\n- 情绪化抱怨\n\n## 晋升规则\n\n只有满足下面条件，才考虑从 `.learnings/` 晋升到长期文件：\n\n- 同类问题重复出现\n- 已验证，不是偶发噪音\n- 对未来任务有明显复用价值\n- 不涉及敏感信息\n\n### 晋升目标\n- 行为准则 → `SOUL.md`\n- 工作流规则 → `AGENTS.md`\n- 工具坑点 / 本地环境经验 → `TOOLS.md`\n- 长期稳定偏好 / 长期决策 → `MEMORY.md`\n\n## 当前策略\n\n- 默认手动记录\n- 默认手动筛选\n- 默认不开 hook 自动写入\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/README.md\",\"content\":\"# .learnings 使用规则\\n\\n这个目录是**暂存层**，不是长期记忆层。\\n\\n## 记录什么\\n\\n### 1. ERRORS.md\\n记录：\\n- 命令失败\\n- tool 调用失败\\n- 外部 API 异常\\n- 文档与实际行为不一致的初步发现\\n\\n### 2. LEARNINGS.md\\n记录：\\n- 用户明确纠正\\n- 已验证的更优做法\\n- 重复出现的工作流经验\\n- 已确认的知识缺口\\n\\n### 3. FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\\n记录：\\n- 当前不会、但用户明确需要的新能力\\n- 适合以后沉淀成 skill / workflow / script 的需求\\n\\n## 不记录什么\\n\\n- 密码、密钥、token、恢复码\\n- 私人代码、未发布内容、敏感日志\\n- 只出现一次、未经验证的猜测\\n- 情绪化抱怨\\n\\n## 晋升规则\\n\\n只有满足下面条件，才考虑从 `.learnings/` 晋升到长期文件：\\n\\n- 同类问题重复出现\\n- 已验证，不是偶发噪音\\n- 对未来任务有明显复用价值\\n- 不涉及敏感信息\\n\\n### 晋升目标\\n- 行为准则 → `SOUL.md`\\n- 工作流规则 → `AGENTS.md`\\n- 工具坑点 / 本地环境经验 → `TOOLS.md`\\n- 长期稳定偏好 / 长期决策 → `MEMORY.md`\\n\\n## 当前策略\\n\\n- 默认手动记录\\n- 默认手动筛选\\n- 默认不开 hook 自动写入\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":225,"output":404,"cacheRead":69504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70133,"cost":{"input":0.0005625000000000001,"output":0.00606,"cacheRead":0.017376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0239985}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773841284020}}
