{"type":"message","id":"4a359a31","parentId":"00b48643","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:41:55.594Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 继续推进好了，我已经把它**接进你当前工作流**了，而且是稳的做法。  \n\n**我刚做的事**\n- 在 `AGENTS.md` 里加了 **Self-Improvement Logging Rules**\n- 在 `TOOLS.md` 里补了这个 skill 的本地使用约束\n- 新建了：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/README.md`\n\n**现在的策略**\n- `.learnings/` 只做**暂存层**\n- **默认手动记录**\n- **默认手动筛选**\n- **默认不开 hook 自动写入**\n- 不允许把 `.learnings/` 里的内容自动晋升到 `SOUL.md / AGENTS.md / TOOLS.md / MEMORY.md`\n\n**这套接法的好处**\n- 能开始积累错误和经验\n- 又不会把工作区搞成“自动写垃圾记忆”的状态\n- 后面你要升级成自动化，也有清晰边界\n\n**下一步我建议直接做这个**\n我帮你再做一个 **范总定制版 self-improving-agent**，把现在这个通用版改成更适合你的：\n1. 中文优先  \n2. 只记录高价值错误  \n3. 自动过滤噪音  \n4. 对接 OpenClaw Bug Hunting 计划  \n5. 输出更适合你项目群协作\n\n你回我一句：**“做定制版”**，我就直接开干。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baab9c6c8c8191b20ebcd8631facfd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":147,"output":334,"cacheRead":70016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70497,"cost":{"input":0.00036750000000000004,"output":0.00501,"cacheRead":0.017504,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0228815}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773841299960}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa1c4616","parentId":"4a359a31","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:42:48.222Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b549ef3b54ca8b3998bcb255bdf7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 21:42 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b549ef3b54ca8b3998bcb255bdf7]\n范: 继续"}],"timestamp":1773841368209}}
