{"type":"message","id":"d1519cf7","parentId":"2d0270c7","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:42:57.382Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_hKlDzEquGVz7ZLJ1VMnWBM37|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baabe11bd081918456f47994e61988","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: self-improvement\ndescription: \"Captures learnings, errors, and corrections to enable continuous improvement. Use when: (1) A command or operation fails unexpectedly, (2) User corrects Claude ('No, that's wrong...', 'Actually...'), (3) User requests a capability that doesn't exist, (4) An external API or tool fails, (5) Claude realizes its knowledge is outdated or incorrect, (6) A better approach is discovered for a recurring task. Also review learnings before major tasks.\"\nmetadata:\n---\n\n# Self-Improvement Skill\n\nLog learnings and errors to markdown files for continuous improvement. Coding agents can later process these into fixes, and important learnings get promoted to project memory.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Command/operation fails | Log to `.learnings/ERRORS.md` |\n| User corrects you | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `correction` |\n| User wants missing feature | Log to `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md` |\n| API/external tool fails | Log to `.learnings/ERRORS.md` with integration details |\n| Knowledge was outdated | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `knowledge_gap` |\n| Found better approach | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `best_practice` |\n| Simplify/Harden recurring patterns | Log/update `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with `Source: simplify-and-harden` and a stable `Pattern-Key` |\n| Similar to existing entry | Link with `**See Also**`, consider priority bump |\n| Broadly applicable learning | Promote to `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and/or `.github/copilot-instructions.md` |\n| Workflow improvements | Promote to `AGENTS.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n| Tool gotchas | Promote to `TOOLS.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n| Behavioral patterns | Promote to `SOUL.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n\n## OpenClaw Setup (Recommended)\n\nOpenClaw is the primary platform for this skill. It uses workspace-based prompt injection with automatic skill loading.\n\n### Installation\n\n**Via ClawdHub (recommended):**\n```bash\nclawdhub install self-improving-agent\n```\n\n**Manual:**\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/peterskoett/self-improving-agent.git ~/.openclaw/skills/self-improving-agent\n```\n\nRemade for openclaw from original repo : https://github.com/pskoett/pskoett-ai-skills - https://github.com/pskoett/pskoett-ai-skills/tree/main/skills/self-improvement\n\n### Workspace Structure\n\nOpenClaw injects these files into every session:\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace/\n├── AGENTS.md          # Multi-agent workflows, delegation patterns\n├── SOUL.md            # Behavioral guidelines, personality, principles\n├── TOOLS.md           # Tool capabilities, integration gotchas\n├── MEMORY.md          # Long-term memory (main session only)\n├── memory/            # Daily memory files\n│   └── YYYY-MM-DD.md\n└── .learnings/        # This skill's log files\n    ├── LEARNINGS.md\n    ├── ERRORS.md\n    └── FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\n```\n\n### Create Learning Files\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings\n```\n\nThen create the log files (or copy from `assets/`):\n- `LEARNINGS.md` — corrections, knowledge gaps, best practices\n- `ERRORS.md` — command failures, exceptions\n- `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md` — user-requested capabilities\n\n### Promotion Targets\n\nWhen learnings prove broadly applicable, promote them to workspace files:\n\n| Learning Type | Promote To | Example |\n|---------------|------------|---------|\n| Behavioral patterns | `SOUL.md` | \"Be concise, avoid disclaimers\" |\n| Workflow improvements | `AGENTS.md` | \"Spawn sub-agents for long tasks\" |\n| Tool gotchas | `TOOLS.md` | \"Git push needs auth configured first\" |\n\n### Inter-Session Communication\n\nOpenClaw provides tools to share learnings across sessions:\n\n- **sessions_list** — View active/recent sessions\n- **sessions_history** — Read another session's transcript  \n- **sessions_send** — Send a learning to another session\n- **sessions_spawn** — Spawn a sub-agent for background work\n\n### Optional: Enable Hook\n\nFor automatic reminders at session start:\n\n```bash\n# Copy hook to OpenClaw hooks directory\ncp -r hooks/openclaw ~/.openclaw/hooks/self-improvement\n\n# Enable it\nopenclaw hooks enable self-improvement\n```\n\nSee `references/openclaw-integration.md` for complete details.\n\n---\n\n## Generic Setup (Other Agents)\n\nFor Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, or other agents, create `.learnings/` in your project:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p .learnings\n```\n\nCopy templates from `assets/` or create files with headers.\n\n### Add reference to agent files AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, or .github/copilot-instructions.md to remind yourself to log learnings. (this is an alternative to hook-based reminders)\n\n#### Self-Improvement Workflow\n\nWhen errors or corrections occur:\n1. Log to `.learnings/ERRORS.md`, `LEARNINGS.md`, or `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n2. Review and promote broadly applicable learnings to:\n   - `CLAUDE.md` - project facts and conventions\n   - `AGENTS.md` - workflows and automation\n   - `.github/copilot-instructions.md` - Copilot context\n\n## Logging Format\n\n### Learning Entry\n\nAppend to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## [LRN-YYYYMMDD-XXX] category\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 timestamp\n**Priority**: low | medium | high | critical\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: frontend | backend | infra | tests | docs | config\n\n### Summary\nOne-line description of what was learned\n\n### Details\nFull context: what happened, what was wrong, what's correct\n\n### Suggested Action\nSpecific fix or improvement to make\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: conversation | error | user_feedback\n- Related Files: path/to/file.ext\n- Tags: tag1, tag2\n- See Also: LRN-20250110-001 (if related to existing entry)\n- Pattern-Key: simplify.dead_code | harden.input_validation (optional, for recurring-pattern tracking)\n- Recurrence-Count: 1 (optional)\n- First-Seen: 2025-01-15 (optional)\n- Last-Seen: 2025-01-15 (optional)\n\n---\n```\n\n### Error Entry\n\nAppend to `.learnings/ERRORS.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## [ERR-YYYYMMDD-XXX] skill_or_command_name\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 timestamp\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: frontend | backend | infra | tests | docs | config\n\n### Summary\nBrief description of what failed\n\n### Error\n```\nActual error message or output\n```\n\n### Context\n- Command/operation attempted\n- Input or parameters used\n- Environment details if relevant\n\n### Suggested Fix\nIf identifiable, what might resolve this\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes | no | unknown\n- Related Files: path/to/file.ext\n- See Also: ERR-20250110-001 (if recurring)\n\n---\n```\n\n### Feature Request Entry\n\nAppend to `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## [FEAT-YYYYMMDD-XXX] capability_name\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 timestamp\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: frontend | backend | infra | tests | docs | config\n\n### Requested Capability\nWhat the user wanted to do\n\n### User Context\nWhy they needed it, what problem they're solving\n\n\n[428 more lines in file. Use offset=221 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773841377366}}
{"type":"message","id":"fc0f192b","parentId":"d1519cf7","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:42:57.401Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_kKvOnRo8yb7z7JZedDhKy9Qx|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baabe11bdc8191baf801a30f41fb52","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/assets/LEARNINGS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/assets/SKILL-TEMPLATE.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/ERRORS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/_meta.json\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/examples.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/hooks-setup.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/openclaw-integration.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/activator.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/error-detector.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/extract-skill.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":21,"aggregated":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/assets/LEARNINGS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/assets/SKILL-TEMPLATE.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/ERRORS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/_meta.json\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/examples.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/hooks-setup.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/openclaw-integration.md\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/activator.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/error-detector.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/scripts/extract-skill.sh\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773841377387}}
{"type":"message","id":"fade82b9","parentId":"fc0f192b","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:43:45.240Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering file edits**\n\nI’m thinking about simplifying the SKILL.md and adding a README, but I also don’t want to include extra documentation from the skill creator since I’ve already copied it over. I might be able to keep some of it. I should customize the name and description and add references, but maybe I could also remove the hook documentation since it might not be necessary. Ultimately, I want to create a concise SKILL and a useful reference.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0099dfe7541593d80169baabe6fd4881919e1b8448c179f98c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuqvqGN3FCt4xvNjJ15Cn_f_ORWoU90a_0LZ3dS7_Gr-6wr8v--GhDkibFWHOxXpDVf2VIN_j7Xm4WVhspeZecfUjyVckPnHsSgkA_t8w4f0kdikgsiRp58SXuYAo2Pv3RxxK7bLptJ-cFrHSbaID3iL5Pn1eMspPTQ2-nmy9wTeEMN_xeIPaQu2zPfVwDxQLPcSBghutczmFDnxwXnk1DZeyFW65n8QkuNKIgvShnl61nX2YMfHniu_hZkI2-dUVcGFrATacQnjUHAgzKRcZUhETciPmjHWzxhZqnXY6Wubz8_2XCcB4Zwrp6u8f35CgpdVIC8B4xIIQlQGO3BUrPFLZfGr_b7qrTK1NO67FAMq0_4oHkhEnbyh_ef9_UEbVup6rDKXWMu1SL0_coUlEUV5snJBdGJvoejP66m2lj9ib4r-DGOFiHfYoc1g43I4okJ6U0IM_40TdjIcbRwgEkXUmns04pv9hhm6GS9h1aNByktKnQnKPIYLRK78CC1DqZUb8izzrkssJh9i2g59hK6DIFW98xNreXuxJOIAUdRZMoJVT2Z0P5hT0kVYwwn7eprSzW2ibuIKn0o8FyqZOQdtHU8PuPmBtopnx6PIEigh29yYYRVrZIrNppnWhaBbDQpizhQT2ZgGsz5PbZ-_azAwgFKf9RJ6e18BHXx-PGeQVbE3F6GuZWSSxQW-_yYua-a2d9uVzWrDc0LakcbvfOXVoR6oFTgQxNi0CD9deqfZpezDKEs5j8Z4rsjB0cCfT2aEe0Zqyf0mC5Fxcj7syBH0K0wAmVgtysWbQXCA42xin_L16hl8WQrbhtWqBK-8UvVgWq_3IGfSzi1RC7cW74ApzhfzSEByoRHO6oVL6USCA39ajk4bO21XUzs7wfjaBDaw811tb6JLx7ZJPX2diNm6nYmHzfs5eohLK_vCXCf7POSsH5Zi6U0iAPw-pw-VVr8Q6xIlNkcYwJ77dG40_qwV8CBTO9ln_6ut-TyrZZhJJu9mv3Appg415FmxCI6gOCpRaw7q0orHucs3nO9vIWScPM0ho6kWsrVxfg3jRR3CZ-tL6IEv96tnP5P1DYIqBBctAUGUtlkbp2gsYBJQVPqkDXdgghlwpsC5XmEnQvICCn-dGEqOw83dAr885XwOvLMfi-mahBSEezzFeR22VRdaaJPBL9e_15Q5aXxy-bS6h8UM74XLijjCiBAAE_ir9WWQX6wzqzj5QyN6IqoMGoX8zE_lyYtlKP7XjCo0k5UOuw9JnNstlCqq4f-YNOULZvRfKfXuPUN-nL-Xk2NRYge4o2w==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering file edits**\\n\\nI’m thinking about simplifying the SKILL.md and adding a README, but I also don’t want to include extra documentation from the skill creator since I’ve already copied it over. I might be able to keep some of it. I should customize the name and description and add references, but maybe I could also remove the hook documentation since it might not be necessary. Ultimately, I want to create a concise SKILL and a useful reference.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先把这份定制版收紧：名字、触发条件、记录规则、晋升规则，全部按你现在的工作流改。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baabeafc808191980f4a52c20bbc88\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_AdkXhZmh0pgecLrcIW1xh1dX|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac10f7c88191841cab597c76ba31","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: fanzong-self-improving-agent\ndescription: \"中文优先的自我改进与经验沉淀技能。用于 OpenClaw 工作流中的错误记录、用户纠正记录、能力缺口记录、重复踩坑归档，以及 Bug Hunting / issue 提交前的经验复盘。适用于：(1) 命令、工具、外部 API 调用失败，(2) 用户明确纠正，(3) 发现更稳妥的固定做法，(4) 暴露出缺失能力或待建设流程，(5) 准备做重要任务前回顾历史踩坑。\"\n---\n\n# Fanzong Self-Improving Agent\n\n把 `.learnings/` 当作**暂存层**，不是长期记忆层。\n\n## 核心规则\n\n- 只记录**高价值**内容，拒绝流水账\n- 中文优先，写短句，结论先行\n- 不自动把 `.learnings/` 晋升到 `SOUL.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`MEMORY.md`\n- 只有“重复出现 + 已验证 + 可复用”的经验，才允许晋升\n- 不写入密钥、token、私人代码、敏感日志、未发布内容\n- 默认手动记录，默认不开 hook\n\n## 何时使用\n\n### 1. 记入 `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\n用于：\n- `exec` / `process` / `browser` / `message` / `sessions_*` 等工具调用失败\n- 外部 API 报错\n- 文档步骤走不通\n- 实际行为与文档明显不一致\n- 同类问题重复出现\n\n### 2. 记入 `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\n用于：\n- 用户明确纠正\n- 发现更优且可复用的工作方法\n- 识别出稳定的 Bug Hunting / 排障套路\n- 确认某个技能、工具、命令在当前环境下的可靠做法\n\n### 3. 记入 `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n用于：\n- 用户提出当前不具备的新能力\n- 值得后续沉淀成 skill / script / workflow 的需求\n\n## 不该记录的内容\n\n- 一次性小失误且没有复用价值\n- 未经验证的猜测\n- 情绪化抱怨\n- 只是“这次没做好”，但没有提炼出原因和对策\n- 任何敏感信息\n\n## 记录格式要求\n\n每条记录都尽量包含：\n- **Summary**：一句话说清问题或经验\n- **Context**：发生在什么任务里\n- **Decision / Fix**：以后怎么做\n- **Reusability**：是否可复用，给谁复用\n\n## 晋升规则\n\n只有满足下面 4 条，才考虑晋升：\n\n1. 已验证，不是误判\n2. 至少重复出现过，或明确会反复出现\n3. 对未来任务有明显复用价值\n4. 不涉及敏感信息\n\n### 晋升目标\n\n- 行为与表达规则 → `SOUL.md`\n- 工作流、协作、节奏 → `AGENTS.md`\n- 工具坑点、本地环境经验 → `TOOLS.md`\n- 长期偏好、稳定决策 → `MEMORY.md`\n\n## Bug Hunting 集成规则\n\n在 OpenClaw Bug Hunting / Submission Program 场景下：\n\n- 新发现的问题，先记入 `.learnings/ERRORS.md` 或 `LEARNINGS.md`\n- 能稳定复现后，再整理成 Bug 卡\n- 证据不足，不直接升为 GitHub issue\n- 同类问题出现多次时，优先沉淀“排查路径”和“复现模板”\n\n## 使用方式\n\n### 任务结束后回看\n\n问自己 4 个问题：\n\n1. 这次失败/修正有没有复用价值？\n2. 这是一次性噪音，还是重复模式？\n3. 下次是否能靠一句规则避免？\n4. 这条经验应该停留在 `.learnings/`，还是进入长期文件？\n\n### 重要任务前复盘\n\n开始重要任务前，优先查看：\n- `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\n- `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\n- `.learnings/README.md`\n\n如果记录很多，先筛选最近、重复、高优先级条目。\n\n## 参考文件\n\n需要时再读：\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: fanzong-self-improving-agent\\ndescription: \\\"中文优先的自我改进与经验沉淀技能。用于 OpenClaw 工作流中的错误记录、用户纠正记录、能力缺口记录、重复踩坑归档，以及 Bug Hunting / issue 提交前的经验复盘。适用于：(1) 命令、工具、外部 API 调用失败，(2) 用户明确纠正，(3) 发现更稳妥的固定做法，(4) 暴露出缺失能力或待建设流程，(5) 准备做重要任务前回顾历史踩坑。\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# Fanzong Self-Improving Agent\\n\\n把 `.learnings/` 当作**暂存层**，不是长期记忆层。\\n\\n## 核心规则\\n\\n- 只记录**高价值**内容，拒绝流水账\\n- 中文优先，写短句，结论先行\\n- 不自动把 `.learnings/` 晋升到 `SOUL.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`MEMORY.md`\\n- 只有“重复出现 + 已验证 + 可复用”的经验，才允许晋升\\n- 不写入密钥、token、私人代码、敏感日志、未发布内容\\n- 默认手动记录，默认不开 hook\\n\\n## 何时使用\\n\\n### 1. 记入 `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\\n用于：\\n- `exec` / `process` / `browser` / `message` / `sessions_*` 等工具调用失败\\n- 外部 API 报错\\n- 文档步骤走不通\\n- 实际行为与文档明显不一致\\n- 同类问题重复出现\\n\\n### 2. 记入 `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\\n用于：\\n- 用户明确纠正\\n- 发现更优且可复用的工作方法\\n- 识别出稳定的 Bug Hunting / 排障套路\\n- 确认某个技能、工具、命令在当前环境下的可靠做法\\n\\n### 3. 记入 `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\\n用于：\\n- 用户提出当前不具备的新能力\\n- 值得后续沉淀成 skill / script / workflow 的需求\\n\\n## 不该记录的内容\\n\\n- 一次性小失误且没有复用价值\\n- 未经验证的猜测\\n- 情绪化抱怨\\n- 只是“这次没做好”，但没有提炼出原因和对策\\n- 任何敏感信息\\n\\n## 记录格式要求\\n\\n每条记录都尽量包含：\\n- **Summary**：一句话说清问题或经验\\n- **Context**：发生在什么任务里\\n- **Decision / Fix**：以后怎么做\\n- **Reusability**：是否可复用，给谁复用\\n\\n## 晋升规则\\n\\n只有满足下面 4 条，才考虑晋升：\\n\\n1. 已验证，不是误判\\n2. 至少重复出现过，或明确会反复出现\\n3. 对未来任务有明显复用价值\\n4. 不涉及敏感信息\\n\\n### 晋升目标\\n\\n- 行为与表达规则 → `SOUL.md`\\n- 工作流、协作、节奏 → `AGENTS.md`\\n- 工具坑点、本地环境经验 → `TOOLS.md`\\n- 长期偏好、稳定决策 → `MEMORY.md`\\n\\n## Bug Hunting 集成规则\\n\\n在 OpenClaw Bug Hunting / Submission Program 场景下：\\n\\n- 新发现的问题，先记入 `.learnings/ERRORS.md` 或 `LEARNINGS.md`\\n- 能稳定复现后，再整理成 Bug 卡\\n- 证据不足，不直接升为 GitHub issue\\n- 同类问题出现多次时，优先沉淀“排查路径”和“复现模板”\\n\\n## 使用方式\\n\\n### 任务结束后回看\\n\\n问自己 4 个问题：\\n\\n1. 这次失败/修正有没有复用价值？\\n2. 这是一次性噪音，还是重复模式？\\n3. 下次是否能靠一句规则避免？\\n4. 这条经验应该停留在 `.learnings/`，还是进入长期文件？\\n\\n### 重要任务前复盘\\n\\n开始重要任务前，优先查看：\\n- `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\\n- `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\\n- `.learnings/README.md`\\n\\n如果记录很多，先筛选最近、重复、高优先级条目。\\n\\n## 参考文件\\n\\n需要时再读：\\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_JMNMGrIWgal24uiILxlWpIi9|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac10f7dc819190d89214df8b9235","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/logging-templates.md","content":"# Logging Templates\n\n## 1. ERRORS.md 模板\n\n```md\n## [ERR-YYYYMMDD-001] 工具或流程名\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\n**Priority**: medium | high | critical\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Summary\n一句话说清失败点\n\n### Context\n- 任务：\n- 触发动作：\n- 涉及工具/命令：\n- 环境：\n\n### Error\n```text\n关键报错或异常现象\n```\n\n### Decision / Fix\n下次如何规避或修复\n\n### Reusability\n- 是否会重复出现：yes | no | unknown\n- 适合沉淀到哪里：none | TOOLS.md | AGENTS.md\n```\n\n## 2. LEARNINGS.md 模板\n\n```md\n## [LRN-YYYYMMDD-001] 分类名\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\n**Priority**: low | medium | high\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Summary\n一句话经验\n\n### Context\n这条经验来自什么任务\n\n### Decision / Fix\n以后统一怎么做\n\n### Reusability\n- 复用对象：self | team | workspace\n- 是否适合晋升：yes | no | later\n```\n\n## 3. FEATURE_REQUESTS.md 模板\n\n```md\n## [FEAT-YYYYMMDD-001] 能力名\n\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\n**Priority**: low | medium | high\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Requested Capability\n用户要什么\n\n### Why It Matters\n为什么值得做\n\n### Possible Form\n- skill\n- script\n- workflow\n- doc\n```\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/logging-templates.md\",\"content\":\"# Logging Templates\\n\\n## 1. ERRORS.md 模板\\n\\n```md\\n## [ERR-YYYYMMDD-001] 工具或流程名\\n\\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\\n**Priority**: medium | high | critical\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Summary\\n一句话说清失败点\\n\\n### Context\\n- 任务：\\n- 触发动作：\\n- 涉及工具/命令：\\n- 环境：\\n\\n### Error\\n```text\\n关键报错或异常现象\\n```\\n\\n### Decision / Fix\\n下次如何规避或修复\\n\\n### Reusability\\n- 是否会重复出现：yes | no | unknown\\n- 适合沉淀到哪里：none | TOOLS.md | AGENTS.md\\n```\\n\\n## 2. LEARNINGS.md 模板\\n\\n```md\\n## [LRN-YYYYMMDD-001] 分类名\\n\\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\\n**Priority**: low | medium | high\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Summary\\n一句话经验\\n\\n### Context\\n这条经验来自什么任务\\n\\n### Decision / Fix\\n以后统一怎么做\\n\\n### Reusability\\n- 复用对象：self | team | workspace\\n- 是否适合晋升：yes | no | later\\n```\\n\\n## 3. FEATURE_REQUESTS.md 模板\\n\\n```md\\n## [FEAT-YYYYMMDD-001] 能力名\\n\\n**Logged**: ISO-8601 时间\\n**Priority**: low | medium | high\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Requested Capability\\n用户要什么\\n\\n### Why It Matters\\n为什么值得做\\n\\n### Possible Form\\n- skill\\n- script\\n- workflow\\n- doc\\n```\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PgKPFUkmrXADdzSgMXbmaE3N|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac10f7ec8191beccfaeffe503a86","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/review-checklist.md","content":"# Review Checklist\n\n## 周度复盘\n\n每周复盘 `.learnings/` 时，按这个顺序：\n\n1. 删掉无复用价值的噪音条目\n2. 合并重复问题\n3. 标出高频坑点\n4. 提炼可执行规则\n5. 判断是否需要晋升到长期文件\n\n## 晋升判断\n\n只有同时满足下面条件，才建议晋升：\n\n- 已验证\n- 非偶发\n- 可复用\n- 无敏感信息\n- 能用一句清晰规则表达\n\n## 不要晋升的内容\n\n- 只出现一次的偶发问题\n- 环境特有且不可复用的问题\n- 还没确认根因的推测\n- 情绪化总结\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/review-checklist.md\",\"content\":\"# Review Checklist\\n\\n## 周度复盘\\n\\n每周复盘 `.learnings/` 时，按这个顺序：\\n\\n1. 删掉无复用价值的噪音条目\\n2. 合并重复问题\\n3. 标出高频坑点\\n4. 提炼可执行规则\\n5. 判断是否需要晋升到长期文件\\n\\n## 晋升判断\\n\\n只有同时满足下面条件，才建议晋升：\\n\\n- 已验证\\n- 非偶发\\n- 可复用\\n- 无敏感信息\\n- 能用一句清晰规则表达\\n\\n## 不要晋升的内容\\n\\n- 只出现一次的偶发问题\\n- 环境特有且不可复用的问题\\n- 还没确认根因的推测\\n- 情绪化总结\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_WOgXbppJi0ACKd3mHxthS1vS|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac10f7f88191b6be31f8c501fa6a","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/_meta.json","content":"{\n  \"ownerId\": \"local-custom\",\n  \"slug\": \"fanzong-self-improving-agent\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0-local\",\n  \"publishedAt\": 1773841320000\n}\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/_meta.json\",\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"ownerId\\\": \\\"local-custom\\\",\\n  \\\"slug\\\": \\\"fanzong-self-improving-agent\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0-local\\\",\\n  \\\"publishedAt\\\": 1773841320000\\n}\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":11907,"output":2023,"cacheRead":61184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75114,"cost":{"input":0.029767500000000002,"output":0.030345,"cacheRead":0.015295999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0754085}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773841377393}}
