{"type":"message","id":"9b3e4333","parentId":"d7087b6e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:43:58.185Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering script cleanup**\n\nI’m thinking about whether to remove unnecessary scripts or hooks. It could be helpful to mention the custom skill created, and maybe even clean out old copied clutter. Since I need to continue, I might inspect further to find what's relevant. However, removing files can feel destructive — should I really ask about that? Maybe it’s better to leave things as they are. I just need to ensure I provide a concise update.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0099dfe7541593d80169baac1457ec81919994e39ff63895b1\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuqwYBqKrumf0UnoFEYPgVm8HxrxoYpOnBRpoHzk3oYR8oHu160OYNOBKW2Xg0wG0KcDxv0sG0qYvkge77JZy8GbAf7Nm4wyU4U5bGDp-wgtp1yapAvW4LaBpRJD8N3Pzc6avVT7NWUXN7b-qLzguhYBjGG1RlLtaZx7GFBISpnk2aM62FeqKd6oHVHZW4KgpA3LMuX3yVuU-B_WJQ08LjX8AOrmBHiow7zpUghFrbrr8xJltl2WsmvvCH-03E8yhWD0GcnJZyUwKmaOawqWfxQsEx44LQZEzaGs2gtps4DvNu65eeMrMo_TSuzclkW7q7z1RtfYeWWNeMSwktNSLMlgPnUSQvTYbt-fJCLof29jqVNvR-XuxLGVLpMsNFRo-yehItB9pb2Ljw777sGrgHwKVHO0zvr5Eb95Ms3sGaj48i_5hoLKtg8-Z-oYqLqfgZjj4hHBKXKNcx-NMFJQptz1JLpKT1JjM-7hgPV7YsTIOnfXfxRepqKQgd_ETrC2nOjyB3gJfYvACk7lA6ZiR99InWmMv1H8hseLE-9Uvd4bLusFHQhoY9clRA6vXTSOb8xIOO6kF8cx_E-7Fj6MoWSswdCVP090UyikDu7U-xXcWU6d7ztWgRubiBtAhjEdkgvNDqslNwu3YP9SVrsORi56n-EZi4YCIm-aBEXvAv5aZWgdx-n36zUE8TDaSMFJ3JINC5-HSyozcP1kQ6mzv9HbZhswg0EAjSphZc-4-ihJcOQteZkD8WDxhd1T4_7jy-LOC29LfNC3mTJp-6dT-u-u6ne14pdh-Vkz0b1XKNC7JWAw1mURqGNJ_22Cu8I4LP3D0mMOsY9BtHBR3i-6tA-r1Io79ZDuAPR8weE-zUXMflaQLN139pQguIoae_IVXLB1jI4mR5-Pjwm7VvoJq7Hocp1BKj4FyBnizeaeRCAuaMb42chVSncwsZsTrZQd3bRZtmvfF27hHb4GadsgUw3MCWRltFHdP6Dr4R93OF4dDmQy_YbbSbpIZM7Ca1w0lGIj28q1GHCzhkt3EeRIdAfOGn8RSWlqQkGa351VutZx7Fw8oFYhc2JbEtOVoCqE7UwK0IENBgYZwJu6o82KGczuq1Ajvc0yma2ZWM7zjJH8AqCQPTbJ_7YDqCg4-zGrZz1uKm_1O-ZMEi07G6Ydzi3r5XqUlvnD2D3P2_VZxR4ej1h4XVK0cVnKlliw1_pJPm8DBysS6tuDHW1n0XozxSd8yCO59hvjFHP_fnTbNtWUpXlbxD-TXNJlc-ioAWKCq-DB0\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering script cleanup**\\n\\nI’m thinking about whether to remove unnecessary scripts or hooks. It could be helpful to mention the custom skill created, and maybe even clean out old copied clutter. Since I need to continue, I might inspect further to find what's relevant. However, removing files can feel destructive — should I really ask about that? Maybe it’s better to leave things as they are. I just need to ensure I provide a concise update.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 继续好了，定制版我已经做出来了。  \n\n**新技能**\n- 路径：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent`\n- 版本：`1.0.0-local`\n\n**我改了什么**\n- 重写了 `SKILL.md`\n- 触发逻辑改成**中文优先、结论先行**\n- 明确 `.learnings/` 只是**暂存层**\n- 禁止自动晋升到长期记忆\n- 加了两份参考文件：\n  - `references/logging-templates.md`\n  - `references/review-checklist.md`\n\n**这个定制版现在的特点**\n- 更适合你当前的 OpenClaw 工作流\n- 更适合做 **Bug Hunting / issue 提交前复盘**\n- 更强调**只记高价值经验**\n- 更强调**手动筛选、不开自动 hook**\n\n**下一步我建议继续做最后一层**\n我可以再帮你把这个定制版真正“跑起来”，补上：\n1. 一套 **首批日志模板样例**\n2. 一条 **周度复盘流程**\n3. 一份 **和 Bug Hunting 计划联动的记录规范**\n\n你回我一句：**“继续落地”**，我就把这三块直接补完。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baac1844d081918f5ef86f8862b3bb\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":258,"output":369,"cacheRead":75008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75635,"cost":{"input":0.0006450000000000001,"output":0.005535,"cacheRead":0.018751999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024931999999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773841425279}}
{"type":"message","id":"980f6132","parentId":"9b3e4333","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:44:40.934Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b549e8a49fca4b49b9ba1f06342d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-18 21:44 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b549e8a49fca4b49b9ba1f06342d]\n范: 继续"}],"timestamp":1773841480924}}
{"type":"message","id":"6007bf5e","parentId":"980f6132","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:45:29.943Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Continuing edits on workflow**\n\nI need to utilize the skill-creator that I’ve worked on previously. The next step is to keep going by editing the files and adding templates for the workflow. This seems like a clear and straightforward process, so I’ll make sure I stick to it. I want to ensure that I’m following the right steps, so nothing gets overlooked while I integrate these changes into the workflow.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0099dfe7541593d80169baac51fb2c8191ab1de29448d74902\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuqxVRmzkvhFEQPP2p56sUI40v4RdZghkLLnx4rsLeZ49yr5rMnhw99nFKseci3C28BmCZA0kqZP2IGF8mOhCEY55ut7KO0pOFX5R6xM8U6V8pjB98Ya65kB2kUJyJW_TnzPUZywkQH7bbBZbYi4gORneg4cqB1dqX1CJQH6bkQ81ggDyUDkYry2umx6vzdB6Dhwm5D80MoElOEIQJWAl9j1h5D01c7mJ8kbFMYNq-rOoGaGepKHt0ZwL6WSt3bZddOGQSZOtQwpuJQ4W35EHLDMPbf1wsWXzQ2BRlrxUOuM0D1hBXZsb1WqtNKHQWJqhc_W7SwDq9S9UvThUMXopk2VwmSCohnkUSMM3AYYVoylpmbjewISxslMlO6oQ1_nsn11wCgOtRo-CCCoKqCM1ZtRoKcVYEOa42mad1PKTmAHPqgq4JLr-CIH4vP_syulOxrDDLcJNlZzbRMEqw1XHJTQG7bu5qQDYBeAzoh-mY6tKqTdGkopZScc7rKoKdjGzuee4yKOc6l1ftd3R-I5wA-P_dMcm2w3fQuqormOZinsWeNsAQuljZLsutnBlPcF1HLVc19h1LT1w8ARnw8iZgWPCMHNrzeO9HuwriJOeUxvPFGC6jZgA-CxfiBGmmA_WFs0F2esySMsHRfDJhzeh_1ZUPMkb0hghvS-9GLwFAp3Bdb0YDOAU1NtejICH9qRoGUcIdNU5ijvb5UQOzYjFElWbCHdTesdikK9gkuiypq1LoYyuFqFkihFW2aI6ieRhI-5ufKFB7XuszyzqYOwvp0BlHDSN6DyLPmFRiu3sfF4lfp51IRC5enL1jhT4BKXXlzM4GUGi2brL5tl-Dc0aWywsSA4ScH78Eusg3cUJfFe_TQLmPtckdmvhWHmbAFgrYpD_qsOW-3On68i84s5VRdw8SVnwEy42FEMPmpw07x0Vtnznl2MgZcoiZFMjHv4ziTeY\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Continuing edits on workflow**\\n\\nI need to utilize the skill-creator that I’ve worked on previously. The next step is to keep going by editing the files and adding templates for the workflow. This seems like a clear and straightforward process, so I’ll make sure I stick to it. I want to ensure that I’m following the right steps, so nothing gets overlooked while I integrate these changes into the workflow.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我继续把最后一层落地：直接补可用模板、周复盘流程、和 Bug Hunting 联动规范。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baac5548548191a2ec8231a982f772\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_320bsg5ws9W1EqV5l6tFm2bZ|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aaa0819188a5833f63ba3fbc","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md","content":"# Learnings\n\nCorrections, insights, and verified reusable practices.\n\n---\n\n## [LRN-20260318-001] best_practice\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Summary\n`.learnings/` 只作为暂存层，不自动晋升为长期记忆。\n\n### Context\n为 OpenClaw 安装并定制 self-improving-agent 时，确定了更稳妥的经验沉淀方式。\n\n### Decision / Fix\n先记录，再人工筛选；只有重复出现、已验证、可复用的经验，才允许晋升到 `AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`SOUL.md` 或 `MEMORY.md`。\n\n### Reusability\n- 复用对象：workspace\n- 是否适合晋升：later\n\n---\n\n## [LRN-20260318-002] best_practice\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Summary\nOpenClaw 自我改进日志默认手动记录，不开 hook 自动写入。\n\n### Context\n通用版 self-improving-agent 带有 hook 机制，但当前工作流更适合低风险接入。\n\n### Decision / Fix\n先手动记录高价值经验，等日志质量稳定后，再评估是否启用自动化。\n\n### Reusability\n- 复用对象：workspace\n- 是否适合晋升：yes\n\n---\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md\",\"content\":\"# Learnings\\n\\nCorrections, insights, and verified reusable practices.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## [LRN-20260318-001] best_practice\\n\\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\\n**Priority**: high\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Summary\\n`.learnings/` 只作为暂存层，不自动晋升为长期记忆。\\n\\n### Context\\n为 OpenClaw 安装并定制 self-improving-agent 时，确定了更稳妥的经验沉淀方式。\\n\\n### Decision / Fix\\n先记录，再人工筛选；只有重复出现、已验证、可复用的经验，才允许晋升到 `AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`SOUL.md` 或 `MEMORY.md`。\\n\\n### Reusability\\n- 复用对象：workspace\\n- 是否适合晋升：later\\n\\n---\\n\\n## [LRN-20260318-002] best_practice\\n\\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\\n**Priority**: high\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Summary\\nOpenClaw 自我改进日志默认手动记录，不开 hook 自动写入。\\n\\n### Context\\n通用版 self-improving-agent 带有 hook 机制，但当前工作流更适合低风险接入。\\n\\n### Decision / Fix\\n先手动记录高价值经验，等日志质量稳定后，再评估是否启用自动化。\\n\\n### Reusability\\n- 复用对象：workspace\\n- 是否适合晋升：yes\\n\\n---\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rwtZS3TWcwKUCsaLG0AwdUpt|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aab481919a3bd1995f147a78","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/ERRORS.md","content":"# Errors Log\n\nCommand failures, exceptions, and unexpected behaviors.\n\n---\n\n## [ERR-20260318-001] skill-search-command\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T20:12:00+08:00\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Summary\n使用 `rg` 搜索方案内容时失败，当前环境未安装 ripgrep。\n\n### Context\n- 任务：定位当天写过的 OpenClaw 自我提升计划原文\n- 触发动作：全文搜索 workspace\n- 涉及工具/命令：`exec` + `rg`\n- 环境：OpenClaw workspace / Linux\n\n### Error\n```text\n/usr/bin/bash: line 1: rg: command not found\n\nCommand not found\n```\n\n### Decision / Fix\n优先准备降级方案。CLI 搜索先尝试 `rg`，失败时自动退回 `grep -RInE`。\n\n### Reusability\n- 是否会重复出现：yes\n- 适合沉淀到哪里：TOOLS.md\n\n---\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/ERRORS.md\",\"content\":\"# Errors Log\\n\\nCommand failures, exceptions, and unexpected behaviors.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## [ERR-20260318-001] skill-search-command\\n\\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T20:12:00+08:00\\n**Priority**: medium\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Summary\\n使用 `rg` 搜索方案内容时失败，当前环境未安装 ripgrep。\\n\\n### Context\\n- 任务：定位当天写过的 OpenClaw 自我提升计划原文\\n- 触发动作：全文搜索 workspace\\n- 涉及工具/命令：`exec` + `rg`\\n- 环境：OpenClaw workspace / Linux\\n\\n### Error\\n```text\\n/usr/bin/bash: line 1: rg: command not found\\n\\nCommand not found\\n```\\n\\n### Decision / Fix\\n优先准备降级方案。CLI 搜索先尝试 `rg`，失败时自动退回 `grep -RInE`。\\n\\n### Reusability\\n- 是否会重复出现：yes\\n- 适合沉淀到哪里：TOOLS.md\\n\\n---\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_l4DKLEhAeVVLtAyrXM0BisAL|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aac881918dbcb30617761b39","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md","content":"# Feature Requests\n\nCapabilities requested by user that don't currently exist.\n\n---\n\n## [FEAT-20260318-001] bug-hunting-linked-learning-system\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: pending\n\n### Requested Capability\n希望把 OpenClaw 的自我改进日志系统，与 Bug Hunting & Submission Program 联动起来。\n\n### Why It Matters\n这样可以把“踩坑记录 → 可复现问题 → Bug 卡 → Issue / PR”串成闭环，不再只是零散记笔记。\n\n### Possible Form\n- skill\n- workflow\n- doc\n\n---\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md\",\"content\":\"# Feature Requests\\n\\nCapabilities requested by user that don't currently exist.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## [FEAT-20260318-001] bug-hunting-linked-learning-system\\n\\n**Logged**: 2026-03-18T21:45:00+08:00\\n**Priority**: high\\n**Status**: pending\\n\\n### Requested Capability\\n希望把 OpenClaw 的自我改进日志系统，与 Bug Hunting & Submission Program 联动起来。\\n\\n### Why It Matters\\n这样可以把“踩坑记录 → 可复现问题 → Bug 卡 → Issue / PR”串成闭环，不再只是零散记笔记。\\n\\n### Possible Form\\n- skill\\n- workflow\\n- doc\\n\\n---\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1WV1pbzt9ZoS0v3kBpPql1vE|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aad481919258ae77e2ec110d","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/bug-hunting-linkage.md","content":"# Bug Hunting 联动规范\n\n把 `.learnings/` 和 Bug Hunting & Submission Program 接起来，按下面流程走。\n\n## 一、发现问题时\n\n先不要急着提 issue。\n\n### Step 1：先记日志\n- 工具失败、命令异常、文档走不通 → 记入 `ERRORS.md`\n- 已确认的更优做法、用户纠正、稳定排障套路 → 记入 `LEARNINGS.md`\n- 当前缺失但明显值得建设的能力 → 记入 `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n\n### Step 2：判断是否进入 Bug 候选池\n满足任一条件，再进入候选池：\n- 能稳定复现\n- 影响主流程\n- 与文档明显不一致\n- 社区已有多人反馈\n- 即使偶发，但影响严重且证据充分\n\n## 二、从日志到 Bug 卡\n\n当某条 `ERRORS.md` 记录被确认有复用价值时，提炼为 Bug 卡。\n\nBug 卡至少包含：\n- 标题\n- 环境\n- 预期行为\n- 实际行为\n- 最小复现步骤\n- 复现频率\n- 日志/报错\n- 影响范围\n- 初步判断\n- 修复建议\n\n## 三、从 Bug 卡到提交动作\n\n### 适合提 GitHub Issue\n- 真实缺陷\n- 行为与文档冲突\n- 报错误导用户\n- 回归问题\n- 兼容性问题\n\n### 适合直接提 PR\n- 文档修复\n- 错误提示优化\n- 默认值/校验优化\n- 小范围逻辑修正\n\n### 适合内部留档\n- 证据不足\n- 用户误用\n- 设计取舍\n- 已有 issue 且无新增信息\n\n## 四、周度复盘时做什么\n\n每周处理 `.learnings/` 时，顺手做这 4 件事：\n\n1. 合并重复错误\n2. 标出高频坑点\n3. 提炼稳定排查路径\n4. 判断哪些记录值得升级为 Bug 卡或长期规则\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/bug-hunting-linkage.md\",\"content\":\"# Bug Hunting 联动规范\\n\\n把 `.learnings/` 和 Bug Hunting & Submission Program 接起来，按下面流程走。\\n\\n## 一、发现问题时\\n\\n先不要急着提 issue。\\n\\n### Step 1：先记日志\\n- 工具失败、命令异常、文档走不通 → 记入 `ERRORS.md`\\n- 已确认的更优做法、用户纠正、稳定排障套路 → 记入 `LEARNINGS.md`\\n- 当前缺失但明显值得建设的能力 → 记入 `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\\n\\n### Step 2：判断是否进入 Bug 候选池\\n满足任一条件，再进入候选池：\\n- 能稳定复现\\n- 影响主流程\\n- 与文档明显不一致\\n- 社区已有多人反馈\\n- 即使偶发，但影响严重且证据充分\\n\\n## 二、从日志到 Bug 卡\\n\\n当某条 `ERRORS.md` 记录被确认有复用价值时，提炼为 Bug 卡。\\n\\nBug 卡至少包含：\\n- 标题\\n- 环境\\n- 预期行为\\n- 实际行为\\n- 最小复现步骤\\n- 复现频率\\n- 日志/报错\\n- 影响范围\\n- 初步判断\\n- 修复建议\\n\\n## 三、从 Bug 卡到提交动作\\n\\n### 适合提 GitHub Issue\\n- 真实缺陷\\n- 行为与文档冲突\\n- 报错误导用户\\n- 回归问题\\n- 兼容性问题\\n\\n### 适合直接提 PR\\n- 文档修复\\n- 错误提示优化\\n- 默认值/校验优化\\n- 小范围逻辑修正\\n\\n### 适合内部留档\\n- 证据不足\\n- 用户误用\\n- 设计取舍\\n- 已有 issue 且无新增信息\\n\\n## 四、周度复盘时做什么\\n\\n每周处理 `.learnings/` 时，顺手做这 4 件事：\\n\\n1. 合并重复错误\\n2. 标出高频坑点\\n3. 提炼稳定排查路径\\n4. 判断哪些记录值得升级为 Bug 卡或长期规则\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xRfKG4wM9RNyGDZoGn1dwFLu|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aadc8191998b351de5831fed","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-18-self-improving-agent-落地说明.md","content":"# self-improving-agent 落地说明（2026-03-18）\n\n## 已完成\n\n### 1. 安装通用版技能\n- 来源：skillhub\n- 技能：`self-improving-agent`\n- 版本：`3.0.4`\n\n### 2. 初始化日志目录\n已创建：\n- `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\n- `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\n- `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n- `.learnings/README.md`\n\n### 3. 接入当前工作流\n已更新：\n- `AGENTS.md`\n- `TOOLS.md`\n\n核心策略：\n- `.learnings/` 是暂存层，不是长期记忆层\n- 默认手动记录\n- 默认手动筛选\n- 默认不开 hook 自动写入\n\n### 4. 创建范总定制版技能\n路径：`skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent`\n\n新增内容：\n- 定制版 `SKILL.md`\n- `references/logging-templates.md`\n- `references/review-checklist.md`\n- `references/bug-hunting-linkage.md`\n\n## 当前可直接执行的工作流\n\n### 日常记录\n- 错误 → `ERRORS.md`\n- 经验 → `LEARNINGS.md`\n- 新能力诉求 → `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n\n### 周度复盘\n- 删噪音\n- 合并重复问题\n- 找高频坑点\n- 判断是否晋升到长期文件\n\n### Bug Hunting 联动\n- 先记日志\n- 再判断是否进入 Bug 候选池\n- 能复现后整理成 Bug 卡\n- 最后决定提 Issue / PR / 内部留档\n\n## 下一步建议\n\n1. 跑一周真实日志，观察噪音比例\n2. 一周后做第一次人工复盘\n3. 再决定要不要启用半自动化\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-18-self-improving-agent-落地说明.md\",\"content\":\"# self-improving-agent 落地说明（2026-03-18）\\n\\n## 已完成\\n\\n### 1. 安装通用版技能\\n- 来源：skillhub\\n- 技能：`self-improving-agent`\\n- 版本：`3.0.4`\\n\\n### 2. 初始化日志目录\\n已创建：\\n- `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\\n- `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\\n- `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\\n- `.learnings/README.md`\\n\\n### 3. 接入当前工作流\\n已更新：\\n- `AGENTS.md`\\n- `TOOLS.md`\\n\\n核心策略：\\n- `.learnings/` 是暂存层，不是长期记忆层\\n- 默认手动记录\\n- 默认手动筛选\\n- 默认不开 hook 自动写入\\n\\n### 4. 创建范总定制版技能\\n路径：`skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent`\\n\\n新增内容：\\n- 定制版 `SKILL.md`\\n- `references/logging-templates.md`\\n- `references/review-checklist.md`\\n- `references/bug-hunting-linkage.md`\\n\\n## 当前可直接执行的工作流\\n\\n### 日常记录\\n- 错误 → `ERRORS.md`\\n- 经验 → `LEARNINGS.md`\\n- 新能力诉求 → `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\\n\\n### 周度复盘\\n- 删噪音\\n- 合并重复问题\\n- 找高频坑点\\n- 判断是否晋升到长期文件\\n\\n### Bug Hunting 联动\\n- 先记日志\\n- 再判断是否进入 Bug 候选池\\n- 能复现后整理成 Bug 卡\\n- 最后决定提 Issue / PR / 内部留档\\n\\n## 下一步建议\\n\\n1. 跑一周真实日志，观察噪音比例\\n2. 一周后做第一次人工复盘\\n3. 再决定要不要启用半自动化\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_CPMRjmHqQKw2oDk4tK4sclrd|fc_0099dfe7541593d80169baac79aae08191a13ea001768109d4","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md","old_string":"## 参考文件\n\n需要时再读：\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\n","new_string":"## 参考文件\n\n需要时再读：\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\n- `references/bug-hunting-linkage.md`：与 Bug Hunting / Issue 提交流程的联动规范\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/SKILL.md\",\"old_string\":\"## 参考文件\\n\\n需要时再读：\\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## 参考文件\\n\\n需要时再读：\\n- `references/logging-templates.md`：记录模板\\n- `references/review-checklist.md`：周度复盘与晋升检查清单\\n- `references/bug-hunting-linkage.md`：与 Bug Hunting / Issue 提交流程的联动规范\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":5222,"output":2154,"cacheRead":70528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77904,"cost":{"input":0.013055,"output":0.03231,"cacheRead":0.017632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.062997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773841480929}}
