{"type":"message","id":"54a1fd6b","parentId":"93a207f3","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:45:39.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 继续落地完了。现在这套已经不是“装了个 skill”，而是**能直接跑的体系**。  \n\n**我刚补完的东西**\n- 填好了 3 个日志文件的**首批样例**\n  - `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\n  - `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\n  - `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n- 增加了 **Bug Hunting 联动规范**\n  - `skills/fanzong-self-improving-agent/references/bug-hunting-linkage.md`\n- 更新了定制版 skill 的引用说明\n- 另外给你整理了一份总览文档：\n  - `Drafts/2026-03-18-self-improving-agent-落地说明.md`\n\n**现在这套怎么用**\n- 发现错误：记 `ERRORS.md`\n- 发现稳定经验：记 `LEARNINGS.md`\n- 发现缺失能力：记 `FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n- 重要问题：从日志提炼成 **Bug 卡**\n- 最后再决定：**Issue / PR / 内部留档**\n\n**你现在已经有的成果**\n1. 通用版 skill 已安装  \n2. 定制版 skill 已做好  \n3. `.learnings/` 已初始化  \n4. 工作流规则已接入 `AGENTS.md / TOOLS.md`  \n5. Bug Hunting 联动规范已补齐  \n\n**下一步最值的动作**\n我建议下一步不要再继续堆配置了，直接进入**实战阶段**：  \n我可以马上帮你做下面二选一：\n\n### A. 生成第一版 Bug 候选池模板\n适合你明天就开始抓 OpenClaw 的 bug\n\n### B. 生成第一版 Bug 卡模板 + Issue 提交模板\n适合你直接进入“发现问题 → 提 issue”的执行阶段\n\n你回我一个字母：**A** 或 **B**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0099dfe7541593d80169baac7ba7108191ab556b5f490ba09d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":288,"output":429,"cacheRead":77824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78541,"cost":{"input":0.00072,"output":0.006435,"cacheRead":0.019455999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.026610999999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773841529992}}
